// # .github/workflows/ — GitHub Pages Deploy
//
// Logline: The CI pipeline that publishes the website to GitHub
//          Pages on every push to main.
//
// Setup: GitHub-managed YAML only. No application code here.
//
// Beats:
//   1. ci.yml — reusable auto-release from openOODA/openOODA
//      at pin v1.0.14. Fires on push to main.
//   2. deploy.yml — checkout, configure-pages, upload artifact
//      (path: .), deploy-pages. No build step. Published as-is.
